meta {
  name: Create private copies of selected draft events
  type: http
  seq: 24
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/calendar/import/:draft/confirm
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  draft: 
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "select": [
      0
    ],
    "calendar_id": "string"
  }
}

docs {
  Requires the `calendar` feature flag. Repeated selection indices are imported once. The same selection and destination replay the original result for seven days after confirmation, without creating events or notices again. Omitting calendar_id uses the preview's destination; naming that same destination is equivalent. A changed selection or destination returns 409 idempotency_conflict. Replay requires continuing ownership of the destination calendar. See docs/calendar.md.
}
